<title>ITALY: Italy has non-EU trade surplus in January.</title>
<headline>Italy has non-EU trade surplus in January.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy had a 451 billion lire trade surplus with non-European Union countries in January, the national statistics office ISTAT said.</p>
<p>ITALY TRADE BALANCE (NON-EU) Jan 97     Dec 96	Jan 96</p>
<p> Amount (lire)	     +451 bln     +4.403 trln   -273 bln</p>
<p> Imports		     11.280 trln  9.890 trln    11.647 trln</p>
<p> Exports		     11.731 trln  14.293 trln   11.374 trln</p>
</text>
